spans.s:
दृशान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. seeing; (अस्), m. a
ruler, a Loka-pāla or protector of the world, a god
presiding over one of the quarters; N. of a Ṛṣi
with the patronymic Bhārgava; a spiritual teacher;
a Brāhman; N. of a demon, also called Vi-rocana;
(अम्), n. light, brightness.

दृशि, इस्, f. seeing, viewing; (the dat. दृशये
being used in the Veda as an infinitive; cf. 1. दृश्);
(इस्, ई), f. the eye; a Śāstra.
